            <div class="ut-copy field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><div><strong>Important Information:</strong></div><ul><li><div>All deadlines on this academic calendar are in <strong>Central Time (CT)</strong>. Please check your time zone to avoid missing important dates.</div></li><li><div>Refer to the <a href="https://registrar.utexas.edu/schedules" data-entity-type="external"><strong>online course schedule</strong></a> for specific start and end dates for your courses.</div></li><li><div>We strive to ensure all dates listed are accurate; however, occasionally dates may change. Please review updates regularly.</div></li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div><p><a href="https://utexas.box.com/s/v85y8vydyh3xpl45y8zj83qyfmvehi6l">PDF at-a-glance version of this calendar</a></p></div>
      
  </div>
<div class="block-bundle-utexas-promo-list block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockutexas-promo-list clearfix">
  
    
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-block-pl field--type-utexas-promo-list field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item"> <div class="utexas-promo-list-container">
      <h3 class="ut-headline ut-headline--underline">Fall semester runs August 18, 2026 - January 9, 2027, and includes Fall &amp; Winter Terms</h3>
    <div class="ut-promo-list-wrapper">
              <div class="promo-list">
                <div class="content">
                      <h3 class="ut-headline">Fall Term 2026: August 24 - December 14, 2026 </h3>
                                <div class="ut-copy">
              <table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>July 28</td><td>Fall 2026 tuition bills are distributed to students electronically</td></tr><tr><td>August 13</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for undergraduate students who registered for the fall semester on or before August 7</td></tr><tr><td>August 14</td><td>Orientation for new international students</td></tr><tr><td>August 19</td><td>Fall registration for <strong>new </strong>undergraduate and all graduate students who have not yet registered (check your registration information sheet for access times)</td></tr><tr><td>August 20 - 27</td><td>Fall registration for all students</td></tr><tr><td>August 21</td><td>University residence halls open</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day a graduate student may register in absentia</td></tr><tr><td>August 24</td><td>First day of classes</td></tr><tr><td>August 24 - 27</td><td>Fall registration for graduate and law students</td></tr><tr><td>August 24 - 31</td><td>Fall registration for undergraduate students</td></tr><tr><td>August 27</td><td>4th class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day for graduate and law students to add a class</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for graduate and law students</td></tr><tr><td>August 31</td><td>6th class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day for undergraduate students to add a class</td></tr><tr><td>September 7</td><td>Labor Day holiday; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>September 9</td><td>12th class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for anyone who registered on or after August 19.</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Payment for added classes ("Add Bill") is due by 11:59 p.m. Remaining balances will be automatically placed on an installment plan and $15 installment fees will be assessed</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last date for students to opt-out of Longhorn Textbook Access</td></tr><tr><td>October 16</td><td>Payment for remaining tuition balances is due by 11:59 p.m.&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>October 27</td><td>Last day to apply for an undergraduate degree</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;">November 2 - 13</td><td>Spring 2027 registration</td></tr><tr><td>November 13</td><td>Last day to apply for a graduate degree</td></tr><tr><td>November 17</td><td>Spring 2027 tuition bills distributed to students electronically</td></tr><tr><td>November 18</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may: Q-drop a class; withdraw; change a class to pass/fail</td></tr><tr><td>November 20</td><td>Last day a doctoral candidate may hold a dissertation defense for the Fall 2026 semester</td></tr><tr><td>November 23</td><td>Last day a graduate student may change registration in a class to or from credit/no credit basis</td></tr><tr><td>November 23 - 28</td><td>Fall break / Thanksgiving; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>December 4</td><td>Last day to submit master’s report, recital, thesis, doctoral dissertation, or treatise to the graduate dean</td></tr><tr><td>December 7</td><td>Last class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may, with the required approvals, request a non-academic Q-drop</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may register in absentia</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day a graduate student may, with the required approvals, drop a<br>class or withdraw from the university</td></tr><tr><td>December 8 - 9</td><td>Study days</td></tr><tr><td>December 10 - 12 &amp;<br>14</td><td>Final exams</td></tr><tr><td>December 14 - 18</td><td>Spring 2027 registration for continuing and readmitted students</td></tr><tr><td>December 15</td><td>University residence halls close</td></tr><tr><td>December 19</td><td>Official graduation date (no public exercises)</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Winter Term 2026</strong></p><table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:27%;">December 15 -<br>January 9, 2027</td><td>Winter Term</td></tr></tbody></table>
            </div>
                  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item"> <div class="utexas-promo-list-container">
      <h3 class="ut-headline ut-headline--underline">Spring semester runs January 11 - June 2, 2027, and includes Spring &amp; May Terms</h3>
    <div class="ut-promo-list-wrapper">
              <div class="promo-list">
                <div class="content">
                      <h3 class="ut-headline">Spring Term 2027: January 11 - May 3, 2027</h3>
                                <div class="ut-copy">
              <table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>January 5</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for undergraduate students</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Orientation for new international students</td></tr><tr><td>January 7</td><td>Spring 2027 registration for <strong>new </strong>undergraduate students and all graduate students who have not yet registered <span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(33, 37, 41);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:LibreFrank, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">(check your registration information sheet for access times)</span></td></tr><tr><td>January 7 - 10</td><td>Spring 2027 registration for all students <span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(33, 37, 41);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:LibreFrank, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">(check your registration information sheet for access times)</span></td></tr><tr><td>January 8</td><td>University residence halls open</td></tr><tr><td>January 11</td><td>First day of classes</td></tr><tr><td>January 11 - 14</td><td>Spring 2027 registration for graduate and law students</td></tr><tr><td>January 11 - 19&nbsp;</td><td>Spring 2027 registration for undergraduate students</td></tr><tr><td>January 14</td><td>4th class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day for graduate and law students to add a class</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for graduate and law students</td></tr><tr><td>January 18</td><td>Martin Luther King, Jr. Day; no classes held</td></tr><tr><td>January 19</td><td>6th class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day for undergraduate students to add a class</td></tr><tr><td>January 27</td><td>12th class day&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for undergraduate, graduate, and law students</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Payment for added classes ("Add Bill") is due by 11:59 p.m. Remaining balances will be automatically placed on an installment plan and $15 installment fees will be assessed</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last date for students to opt-out of Longhorn Textbook Access</td></tr><tr><td>March 15 - 20</td><td>Spring Break</td></tr><tr><td>March 16</td><td>Payment for remaining balances is due by 11:59 p.m.</td></tr><tr><td>March 24</td><td>Last day to apply for an undergraduate degree</td></tr><tr><td>April 5 - 16</td><td>Summer 2027 and Fall 2027 registration for continuing and readmitted students</td></tr><tr><td>April 9</td><td>Last day to apply for a graduate degree</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day a doctoral candidate may hold a dissertation defense for the Spring 2027 semester</td></tr><tr><td>April 12</td><td>Last day a graduate student may change registration in a class to or from credit/no credit basis</td></tr><tr><td>April 14</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may: Q-drop a class; withdraw; change a class to pass/fail</td></tr><tr><td>April 23</td><td>Last day to submit master’s report, recital, thesis, doctoral dissertation, or treatise to the graduate dean</td></tr><tr><td>April 26</td><td>Last class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may, with the required approvals, request a non-academic Q-drop</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day a graduate student may, with the required approvals, drop a class or withdraw from the University</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate may register in absentia</td></tr><tr><td>April 27 &amp; 28</td><td>Study days</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;">April 29 - 30 &amp; May 1 &amp; 3</td><td>Final exams</td></tr><tr><td>May 4</td><td><span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(33, 37, 41);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:LibreFrank, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">Summer 2026 tuition bills distributed to students electronically</span></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>University residence halls close</td></tr><tr><td>May 8</td><td>University Commencement <span style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(33, 37, 41);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:LibreFrank, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;">(official graduation date)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>May Term 2027</strong></p><table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:27%;">May 4 - June 2</td><td>May Term</td></tr><tr><td>May 31</td><td>Memorial Day; no classes held</td></tr></tbody></table>
            </div>
                  </div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item"> <div class="utexas-promo-list-container">
      <h3 class="ut-headline ut-headline--underline">Summer semester runs June 3 - August 16, 2027, and includes First Term, Second Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</h3>
    <div class="ut-promo-list-wrapper">
              <div class="promo-list">
                <div class="content">
                                <div class="ut-copy">
              <table class="table" style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>May 19</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for undergraduate students</td></tr><tr><td>June 3</td><td>First day of classes for First Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>June 8</td><td>4th class day</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission for First Term, Nine-week Term, and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for undergraduate, graduate, and law students</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Payment for added classes ("add bill") is due by 11:59 p.m. Any owed balance after this will be automatically placed on to installments and $15 installment fees will be assessed</td></tr><tr><td>June 23</td><td>Last day a student may change registration in a First Term, Nine-week Term, or Summer Term class to or from pass/fail or credits/no credit</td></tr><tr><td>July 8</td><td>Last class day for First Term</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate or graduate student may, with the required approvals, drop a First Term class</td></tr><tr><td>July 9 - 10</td><td>Final exams for First Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 12</td><td>First day of classes for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 15</td><td>4th class day for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day to drop a class without permission for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Tuition payment deadline is 5:00 p.m. for undergraduate, graduate, and law students</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Payment for added classes ("add bill") due for Second Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 16</td><td>Last day to apply for undergraduate or law degree</td></tr><tr><td>July 27</td><td>Last class day for Nine-week Term</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate or graduate student may, with required approvals, drop a Nine-week Term class</td></tr><tr><td>July 28 - 29</td><td>Final exams for Nine-week Term</td></tr><tr><td>July 30</td><td>Last day a student may change registration in a First Term, Nine-week Term, or Summer Term class to or from pass/fail or credits/no credit</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day to apply for a graduate degree</td></tr><tr><td>July 28</td><td>Fall 2027 tuition bills distributed to students electronically</td></tr><tr><td>August 13</td><td>Last class day for Second Term and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day an undergraduate or graduate student may, with the required approvals, drop a Second or Summer Term class or withdraw</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Last day to submit a master's report, recital, thesis, doctoral dissertation, or treatise to the graduate dean</td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%;">August 14 &amp; 16</td><td>Final exams for Second Term and Summer Term</td></tr><tr><td>August 16</td><td>Official graduation date (no public exercises)</td></tr></tbody></table>
            </div>
